ople come out after they land."}],"parts":[{"id":"board","word":"departures board","pin":[146,364],"box":[56,334,180,62],"level":"A2","room":"checkin","ipa":"dɪˈpɑːtʃəz bɔːd","pos":"noun","ex":"Check the departures board for your gate.","def":"A big screen that shows the flights, the times and the gates."},{"id":"desk","word":"check-in desk","pin":[150,526],"box":[86,480,128,68],"level":"A2","room":"checkin","ipa":"ˈtʃek ɪn desk","pos":"noun","ex":"Take your bags to the check-in desk.","def":"The desk where you check in for your flight."},{"id":"suitcase","word":"suitcase","pin":[66,518],"box":[44,488,44,46],"level":"A1","room":"checkin","ipa":"ˈsuːtkeɪs","pos":"noun","ex":"My suitcase is too heavy - 25 kilos!","def":"A case with a handle for carrying clothes when you travel."},{"id":"passenger","word":"passenger","pin":[226,500],"box":[204,426,42,122],"level":"A2","room":"checkin","ipa":"ˈpæsɪndʒə","pos":"noun","ex":"All passengers must show their passports.","def":"A person who travels on a plane, a train or a bus."},{"id":"passport","word":"passport","pin":[202,468],"box":[192,458,20,22],"level":"A2","room":"checkin","ipa":"ˈpɑːspɔːt","pos":"noun","ex":"Don't forget your passport!","def":"A small book that shows who you are, for travelling to other countries."},{"id":"officer","word":"security officer","pin":[272,500],"box":[252,426,40,122],"level":"B1","room":"security","ipa":"sɪˈkjʊərəti ˌɒfɪsə","pos":"noun","ex":"The security officer asked me to take off my belt.","def":"A person whose job is to check people and bags at the airport."},{"id":"detector","word":"metal detector","pin":[321,480],"box":[294,426,54,122],"level":"B1","room":"security","ipa":"ˈmetl dɪˌtektə","pos":"noun","ex":"The metal detector beeped because of my keys.","def":"A frame you walk through that beeps if you have metal on you."},{"id":"scanner","word":"scanner","pin":[412,480],"box":[346,462,128,86],"level":"B1","room":"security","ipa":"ˈskænə","pos":"noun","ex":"Put your bag and your lap