claim","ipa":"ˌkærəˈsel","pos":"noun","ex":"Our bags are on carousel number 3.","us":"baggage carousel","def":"The moving belt where your bags come out after the flight."},{"id":"luggage","word":"luggage","pin":[200,686],"box":[66,666,214,40],"level":"B1","room":"reclaim","ipa":"ˈlʌɡɪdʒ","pos":"noun","ex":"How much luggage have you got?","us":"baggage","def":"All the bags and suitcases you take on a journey."},{"id":"trolley","word":"trolley","pin":[346,722],"box":[316,634,70,126],"level":"A2","room":"reclaim","ipa":"ˈtrɒli","pos":"noun","ex":"Put the suitcases on a trolley.","us":"cart","def":"A metal basket on wheels for carrying bags."},{"id":"infodesk","word":"information desk","pin":[708,724],"box":[662,594,96,166],"level":"B1","room":"arrivals","ipa":"ˌɪnfəˈmeɪʃn desk","pos":"noun","ex":"Ask at the information desk where the buses go from.","def":"A desk where you can ask questions."},{"id":"exit","word":"exit","pin":[830,700],"box":[798,608,66,152],"level":"A2","room":"arrivals","ipa":"ˈeksɪt","pos":"noun","ex":"The exit is on the right, after the café.","def":"The way out of a building."},{"id":"sign","word":"sign","pin":[752,690],"box":[738,672,38,28],"level":"A2","room":"arrivals","ipa":"saɪn","pos":"noun","ex":"I held up a sign with her name on it.","def":"A board with words on it. People hold them up to find someone."},{"id":"plane","word":"plane","pin":[1200,628],"box":[916,558,484,134],"level":"A1","room":"plane","ipa":"pleɪn","pos":"noun","ex":"The plane lands at six o'clock.","us":"airplane","def":"A vehicle with wings that flies."},{"id":"cockpit","word":"cockpit","pin":[972,590],"box":[944,576,64,24],"level":"B1","room":"plane","ipa":"ˈkɒkpɪt","pos":"noun","ex":"Children can sometimes visit the cockpit after the flight.","def":"The front part of a plane where the pilots sit."},{"id":"pilot","word":"pilot","pin":[990,592],"box":[980,582,20,20],"level":"A2","room":"plane","ipa":"ˈpaɪlət","pos":"noun","ex":"The pilot says we'll land in twenty minutes.